sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Guard as AGENTGUARD Policy Engine
    participant Payment as Payment Service
    participant Redis as Redis Lock Manager
    participant Razorpay as Razorpay API Rails

    Guard->>Payment: Issue Signed Authorization Context Token (TTL: 15m)
    Payment->>Redis: SETNX lock:idempotency_key (24h TTL)
    Redis-->>Payment: Lock Granted
    Payment->>Payment: Verify Amount, Merchant & Scope Parameters
    Payment->>Razorpay: POST /v1/orders (Execute Settlement)
    Razorpay-->>Payment: Settlement Confirmed (Payment ID)
    Payment-->>Guard: Intent Status -> EXECUTED
